# OpenDream-specific runtime artefacts that should never be committed
AGENTS.md            # the pipeline's OUTPUT in any project that runs OpenDream
.opendream-eval/     # per-trial workspaces produced by `opendream eval run`
/tmp/od_dryrun/      # local prompt-tuning dry-run scratchpad (also outside repo)
